  "description": "Overview HACKDAY is a 24-hour online hackathon by TrishulX. Build something real in a day. Format: 24-hour fully online/virtual hackathon, 14 November 2026, 5:00 PM IST to 15 November 2026, 5:00 PM IST. Solo participants or teams of up to 4. Any tech stack, any theme — build anything. Process: Register on this Unstop page before 13 November 2026, 11:59 PM IST. After registering, join the TrishulX Discord community — all announcements, team help and the project submission details will be shared on Discord during the event. Join here: https://discord.gg/9P4PUf75Yc Build your project during the 24-hour window (14 November 2026, 5:00 PM IST to 15 November 2026, 5:00 PM IST). Judging by the TrishulX panel; winners announced on Discord after the event. Rules: All code must be written fresh during the hackathon window — pre-built projects are not allowed. Your submission must be your team's own work; plagiarism leads to disqualification. One team submits one project. Follow the community code of conduct in the Discord server; the organisers' decision on winners is final.",
