    "details": "<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>\n<p>HACKDAY is a 24-hour online hackathon by TrishulX. Build something real in a day.</p>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>24-hour fully online/virtual hackathon, 14 November 2026, 5:00 PM IST to 15 November 2026, 5:00 PM IST.</li>\n<li>Solo participants or teams of up to 4.</li>\n<li>Any tech stack, any theme &mdash; build anything.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Process:</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Register on this Unstop page before 13 November 2026, 11:59 PM IST.</li>\n<li>After registering, join the TrishulX Discord community &mdash; all announcements, team help and the project submission details will be shared on Discord during the event. Join here: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/9P4PUf75Yc\" data-rich-text-autolink=\"\">https://discord.gg/9P4PUf75Yc</a></li>\n<li>Build your project during the 24-hour window (14 November 2026, 5:00 PM IST to 15 November 2026, 5:00 PM IST).</li>\n<li>Judging by the TrishulX panel; winners announced on Discord after the event.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>All code must be written fresh during the hackathon window &mdash; pre-built projects are not allowed.</li>\n<li>Your submission must be your team's own work; plagiarism leads to disqualification.</li>\n<li>One team submits one project.</li>\n<li>Follow the community code of conduct in the Discord server; the organisers' decision on winners is final.</li>\n</ul>",
